ior Citizen Relaxation Zones\",\"icon\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/senior-citizen-relaxation-zones.svg\"},{\"name\":\"Multipurpose Hall\",\"icon\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/multipurpose-hall.svg\"}],\"builder\":[{\"id\":\"cmir8hggb0052sa5kl4oxhmeh\",\"name\":\"Shreeji Sharan Group\",\"slug\":\"shreeji-sharan\",\"description\":\"The SHREEJI SHARAN Group is the reputable developer behind Shreeji Aikyam, with\\nDesign Studio Architects expertly providing the architectural vision for the project. The\\ngroup's significant credibility in the competitive real estate market is substantiated by its\\nrobust portfolio of successful projects, which includes well-known developments like Shreeji\\nSkyrise, Daivi Eterneety, Shreeji Paradise, and others. This consistent history of delivering\\nmultiple residential developments strongly indicates an established presence and sustained\\ncommitment to the demanding real estate sector. The comprehensive master plan for Shreeji\\nAikyam itself demonstrates a high degree of careful planning, featuring multiple structures,\\ndedicated amenity zones, and strategically designed 6-meter and 9-meter wide driveways for\\nsmooth traffic flow.\",\"logo\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/15/IMAGE/shreeji-sharan-logo-png-3-5a83b4.png\",\"builderLogoPng\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/15/IMAGE/shreeji-sharan-logo-png-3-5a83b4.png\",\"builderLogoJpg\":\"https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/15/IMAGE/shreeji-sharan-logo-jpg-3-78b5a3.jpg\",\"yearsOfExperience\":36,\"totalProjects\":27,\"completedProjects\":17,\"ongoingProjects\":10,\"operatingCityCount\":1,\"displayContact\":false,\"displayNumberWebsite\":null}],\"rating\":0,\"metaTitle\":\"Shreeji Skyrise \",\"metaDescription\":\"Shreeji Skyrise, by the SHREEJI SHARAN Group, is strategically located in Kandivali West,\\r\\noffering seamless connectivity just 0.3 km from the railway station. The project focuses on a\\r\\ncomplete lifestyle, providing a Kids Play Area, Sky Cafe, and Learning Center amenities . it\\r\\n\\r\\noffers thoughtfully planned residential units with RERA Carpet Areas up to 1071 sq. ft.. Its\\r\\nstrong location advantage, near malls and healthcare, makes it a desirable, practical, and well-\\r\\nconnected investment opportunity in the micro-market.\",\"metaKeywords\":[],\"lift\":true,\"parking\":true,\"contactClicks\":0}}],\"$L26\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"27:I[79607,[\"3380\",\"static/chunks/479ba886-f16c34aec6f57180.js\",\"6711\",\"static/chunks/8e1d74a4-2473778c665ba299.js\",\"844\",\"static/chunks/ee560e2c-a118454f5e33a39e.js\",\"8726\",\"static/chunks/951e9828-a32be8f6bfee9c79.js\",\"3873\",\"static/chunks/3d47b92a-300f9802f5a6b29d.js\",\"6084\",\"static/chunks/4e6af11a-5e03d8adac7fa137.js\",\"5479\",\"static/chunks/795d4814-7be7827afedf8686.js\",\"512\",\"static/chunks/9c4e2130-68a1010478ac435d.js\",\"9204\",\"static/chunks/94730671-3d0ce123939c95c9.js\",\"7672\",\"static/chunks/385cb88d-2e94a518db6b64af.js\",\"5239\",\"static/chunks/5239-d688135edae44024.js\",\"3369\",\"static/chunks/3369-d9ac3e4f10488dba.js\",\"2619\",\"static/chunks/2619-b8db57ac19da49ac.js\",\"1124\",\"static/chunks/1124-ddb2a106a3cf54da.js\",\"8270\",\"static/chunks/8270-eaee3d640b0f9340.js\",\"104\",\"static/chunks/104-1b316fe746f690ad.js\",\"7644\",\"static/chunks/7644-47ae1d224c66b824.js\",\"8595\",\"static/chunks/8595-e68898e7d1b05fd8.js\",\"401\",\"static/chunks/401-0dbaec03d81b559d.js\",\"2544\",\"static/chunks/2544-767620c0154fd73d.js\",\"258\",\"static/chunks/258-ba10c8f368894865.js\",\"2725\",\"static/chunks/2725-e5be9de3f5bbae01.js\",\"9718\",\"static/chunks/9718-9b6164c6625483b0.js\",\"8027\",\"static/chunks/8027-d96beba347ca99a8.js\",\"1817\",\"static/chunks/1817-cd7bd3182bdc95c5.js\",\"7903\",\"static/chunks/7903-4a5610d50bfe6293.js\",\"6437\",\"static/chunks/6437-9fa51ed60a9e72d8.js\",\"6923\",\"static/chunks/6923-8a825