            -bottom-1 md:-bottom-1 h-[2px]
          "></span><span class="relative z-0">Project</span></span></h2></div><div class="mt-1 sm:mt-0 flex items-center gap-4 flex-shrink-0"></div></div></div><p class="text-text-secondary font-roboto text-sm md:text-lg text-justify line-clamp-4">Codename SKYRISE, located on S.V. Road opposite the Kandivali Fire Station in Kandivali
West, boasts a highly strategic, valuable location. It is perfectly positioned for residents to
shop, socialize, and connect effortlessly within the wider city network. The project&amp;#39;s
exceptional connectivity is a major real estate advantage, with Kandivali Railway Station
only 0.3 km away and the vital Western Express Highway (WEH) accessible at 2.8 km.
Furthermore, daily conveniences like Dmart, PVR Milaap, and Growels 101 Mall are all well
within easy reach. The residential development features thoughtfully planned layouts to
ensure superior space utilization and comfort. Residents can look forward to unique amenities
that cater to a modern lifestyle, including a dedicated Kids Play Area, a Sky Cafe, and a
Learning Center. Unit RERA Carpet Areas are listed at 781 sq. ft. and 1071 sq. ft.. The
proximity to educational institutions and healthcare like ACE Heart Hospital is another key
benefit. RERA No.: P51800032149.</p></div></section><section id="amenities" class="py-3 md:py-7" data-section="amenities"><div class="flex flex-col "><div class="flex justify-between items-center flex-nowrap mb-4 md:mb-6"><div class="max-w-full w-auto"><h2 class="relative inline-flex flex-wrap items-baseline px-0 text-text-primary font-medium font-plusJakarta text-[18px] md:text-[24px] "><span class="inline-flex flex-wrap items-baseline"><span class="relative inline-block mr-1 md:mb-1"><span class="relative z-0">Amenities</span></span><span class="absolute left-0 w-[32px] md:w-[64px] h-[2px] md:h-1 rounded-t-2xl bg-primary z-0 mt-1 
