true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></section><section id="location" class="py-3 md:py-7" data-section="about-location"><div class=""><div class="flex flex-col "><div class="flex justify-between items-center flex-nowrap mb-4 md:mb-6"><div class="max-w-full w-auto"><h2 class="relative inline-flex flex-wrap items-baseline px-0 text-text-primary font-medium font-plusJakarta text-[18px] md:text-[24px] "><span class="inline-flex flex-wrap items-baseline"><span class="relative inline-block mr-1 md:mb-1"><span class="relative z-0">About</span></span><span class="absolute left-0 w-[32px] md:w-[64px] h-[2px] md:h-1 rounded-t-2xl bg-primary z-0 mt-1 
            -bottom-1 md:-bottom-1 h-[2px]
          "></span><span class="relative z-0">Location</span></span></h2></div><div class="mt-1 sm:mt-0 flex items-center gap-4 flex-shrink-0"></div></div></div><p class="text-text-secondary font-roboto text-sm md:text-lg text-justify line-clamp-4">Kandivali West offers a well-balanced suburban lifestyle with strong infrastructure, convenient transport links, and diverse housing choices. The area’s proximity to major roads and rail routes enhances accessibility across Mumbai. Reputed schools, hospitals, and shopping hubs add to its livability. Continuous development and metro expansion have strengthened its real estate value, making Kandivali West a dependable choice for homebuyers seeking connectivity, comfort, and community-oriented urban living in the city’s western suburbs.</p></div></section><div id="location-map" class="py-3 md:py-7" data-section="map"><div class="w-full  font-sans"><style tag="google-maps-autocomplete">
