econdary border border-white/20"><div class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-bgSecondary/80 backdrop-blur-[2px]"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2"><div class="w-8 h-8 border-4 border-primary border-t-transparent rounded-full animate-spin"></div><p class="text-sm text-label font-medium">Initializing Map...</p></div></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-2 mt-6 px-2"></div></div></div><section id="rera-registered" class="py-3 md:py-7" data-section="rera"><section class="bg-white rounded-[16px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row lg:flex-col xl:flex-row shadow-[1px_1px_8.4px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)] border-t-[5px] md:border-t-0 md:border-l-[5px] lg:border-l-0 lg:border-t-[5px] xl:border-t-0 xl:border-l-[5px] border-primary font-roboto"><div class="flex-1 p-6 flex flex-col justify-start"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 border border-success bg-[#E7FFF0] text-success rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 w-max font-medium font-plusJakarta text-sm md:text-base mb-6"><img alt="Verified" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/icons/green-check.svg"/>RERA Verified Project</div><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2 md:mb-4 lg:mb-2 xl:mb-4"><h3 class="text-[14px] md:text-[24px] font-mendium text-text-primary">What is RERA ?</h3></div><div class="text-text-secondary text-sm md:text-[20px] leading-relaxed space-y-4"><p>RERA (Real Estate Regulatory Authority) is a government regulatory body established under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in India.</p><p>Its primary purpose is to regulate the real estate sector, increase transparency, and protect home buyers from fraud, project delays, and unfair practices.</p></div><div class="mt-4 md:mt-7 flex justify-center md:justify-end lg:justify-center xl:justify-end w-full"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full transition  h-[32px] md:h-[36px] px-6 font-roboto text-[12px] md:text-[14px] lg:text-[16px] bg-primary text-white hover:bg-primary-dark w-full md:w-max lg:w-full xl:w-max !h-[32px] md:!h-[48px] lg:!h-[42px] xl:!h-[48px] !px-12 text-sm md:text-base font-medium shadow-md "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye mr-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>View Certificate</button></div></div><div class="w-full md:w-[350px] lg:w-full xl:w-[300px] shrink-0 bg-callout-primary-light px-4 py-6 md:p-6 lg:px-4 lg:py-6 xl:p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative"><div class="flex flex-row md:flex-col lg:flex-row xl:flex-col items-center justify-around md:justify-center lg:justify-around xl:justify-center w-full gap-4 md:gap-0 lg:gap-4 xl:gap-0 max-w-full"><div class="mb-0 md:mb-4 shrink-0 cursor-pointer group/stamp relative hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300" title="Click to expand RERA QR scanner"><img alt="RERA Approved" loading="lazy" width="147" height="147" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain drop-shadow-md w-[130px] sm:w-[147px] md:w-[140px] lg:w-[147px] xl:w-[140px] h-auto" style="color:transparent" src="https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/rera.png"/></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center shrink-0"><div class="bg-white p-2 md:p-3 lg:p-2 xl:p-3 rounded-[6px] md:rounded-[12px] lg:rounded-[6px] xl:rounded-[12px] shadow-sm mb-2 md:mb-4 lg:mb-2 xl:mb-4 cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 group/qr relative" title="Click to expand RERA QR code"><img alt="RERA QR Code" loading="lazy" width="160" height="160" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[86px] h-[86px] 