            -bottom-1 md:-bottom-1 h-[2px]
          "></span><span class="relative z-0">Developer</span></span></h2></div><div class="mt-1 sm:mt-0 flex items-center gap-4 flex-shrink-0"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-4 my-4 md:mt-4 p-2"><a aria-label="Open Shreeji Sharan Group page" title="Shreeji Sharan Group" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="relative inline-flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 w-[71px] h-[57px] sm:w-[147px] sm:h-[91px] rounded-md transition-transform duration-200 hover:scale-105 focus:scale-105]" href="/builder/shreeji-sharan"><img alt="Shreeji Sharan Group" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/15/IMAGE/shreeji-sharan-logo-jpg-3-78b5a3.jpg"/></a><div class="md:ml-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-text-primary font-medium text-base md:text-2xl font-roboto">Shreeji Sharan Group</span><img alt="Check" loading="lazy" width="14" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-4 w-4 md:h-5 md:w-5" style="color:transparent" src="/icons/green-check.svg"/></div><p class="text-text-primary text-xs md:text-sm mt-2 md:mt-4">Years of Experience –<!-- --> <span class="font-semibold text-text-primary">36<!-- --> years</span></p></div></div><div class="w-full h-px bg-[#9A9A9A80] my-4"></div><div class="mb-4"><p class="text-text-secondary text-sm md:text-lg text-justify line-clamp-4">The SHREEJI SHARAN Group is the reputable developer behind Shreeji Aikyam, with
Design Studio Architects expertly providing the architectural vision for the project. The
group&#x27;s significant credibility in the competitive real estate market is substantiated by its
robust portfolio of successful projects, which includes well-known developments like Shreeji
Skyrise, Daivi Eterneety, Shreeji Paradise, and others. This consistent history of delivering
multiple residential developments strongly indicates an established presence and sustained
commitment to the demanding real estate sector. The comprehensive master plan for Shreeji
Aikyam itself demonstrates a high degree of careful planning, featuring multiple structures,
dedicated amenity zones, and strategically designed 6-meter and 9-meter wide driveways for
smooth traffic flow.</p></div><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3 md:py-4 px-2 rounded-[6px] bg-white mt-4"><div class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center"><span class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-primary mb-1 font-plusJakarta">17</span><span class="text-sm md:text-base text-text-primary">Projects</span><span class="text-xs text-text-secondary">Completed</span></div><div class="w-px self-stretch bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-black/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center"><span class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-primary mb-1 font-plusJakarta">10</span><span class="text-sm md:text-base  text-text-primary">Ongoing</span><span class="text-xs text-text-secondary">Projects</span></div><div class="w-px self-stretch bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-black/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center"><span class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-primary mb-1 font-plusJakarta">1</span><span class="text-sm md:text-base text-text-primary">In City</span><span class="text-xs text-text-secondary">Projects</span></div></div><div class="mt-6 md:mt-8 px-2 md:px-0"><a target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block w-full" href="/builder/shreeji-sharan"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full transition  h-[32px] md:h-[36px] px-6 font-roboto text-[12px] md:text-[14px] lg:text-[16px] bg-primary text-white hover:bg-primary-dark w-full !rounded-full !py-3 text-sm md:text-lg font-medium">View Details</button></a></div></div></section><div class="min-h-[1px]" style="display:none"></div><div class="min-h-[1px]" style="display:none"></div><div class="min-h-[1px]" style="display:none"></div><section class="py-3 md:py-7"><section class="w-full py-3 md:py-7 bg-gray-50/50 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-10 border border-gray-100"><div class="max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-secondary mb-6">Disclaimer</h2><div class="font-roboto space-y-4 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed text-justify text-text-secondary transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden relative max-h-[100px]"><p>NoBrokerage.com is a real estate advertising and information platform. We are not a real estate broker, agent, or channel partner, and we do not facilitate or participate in any property transactions.</p><p>The data displayed on this website is based on inputs from developers, owners, or public sources, and is provided for informational purposes only. While we aim for accuracy, we do not verify the data and make no guarantees regarding its completeness or correctness.</p><p>No information on this website constitutes legal, financial, or investment advice, nor should it be treated as an invitation to purchase or acquire any property. Project listings do not imply RERA registration or regulatory compliance. Users are advised to verify all information independently and consult the relevant RERA authority. All third-party names, images, logos, and trademarks belong to their respective owners.</p><p class="pt-2">For feedback or concerns, email: <a href="mailto:support@nobrokerage.com" class="font-semibold text-primary hover:underline">support@nobrokerage.com</a></p><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-12 bg-gradient-to-t from-gray-50/90 to-transparent"></div></div><button class="mt-4 text-primary font-bold text-xs md:text-sm hover:underline uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors">Read More</button></div></section></section><section id="reviews" class="py-3 md:py-7" data-section="reviews"><div class="w-full h-64 flex items-center justify-center bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3"><div class="w-8 h-8 border-4 border-primary border-t-transparent rounded-full animate-spin"></div><p class="text-text-secondary font-medium">Loading reviews...</p></div></div></section><div class="min-h-[1px]" style="display:none"></div><div class="min-h-[1px]" style="display:none"></div><section id="faq" data-section="faq" class="py-3 md:py-7"><section class="w-full min-w-0 overflow-hidden"><div class="text-start mb-8 md:mb-12"><div class="mb-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 md:gap-x-3"><h1 class="font-plusJakarta text-text-primary text-xl md:text-[48px] lg:text-[35px] xl:text-[48px] font-bold md:font-semibold m-0 leading-none">Frequently Asked</h1><span class="font-Freehand text-2xl md:text-[56px] lg:text-[35px] xl:text-[56px] font-normal text-primary leading-none">Questions</span></div><p class="text-xs md:text-base font-roboto text-text-secondary">Get answers to the most common questions about <!-- -->Shreeji Skyrise in <!-- -->West Pune</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 md:gap-6"><div class="rounded-xl p-4 md:py-5 md:px-8 gap-4 md:gap-6 shadow-md md:shadow-[1px_1px_7px_rgba(0,0,0,0.21)] transition-all duration-300 w-full min-w-0 overflow-hidden max-w-full bg-gray-50"><button class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left gap-3 min-w-0 overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-lg font-roboto transition-colors flex-1 min-w-0 break-words [overflow-wrap:anywhere] [word-break:break-word] pr-2 text-text-primary">Who is the builder of Shreeji Skyrise?</h3><div class="flex h-5 w-5 md:h-8 md:w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full transition-colors bg-[rgba(154,154,154,0.25)]"><svg class="w-[12px] h-[12px] md:w-6 md:h-6 text-[#505050]" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M5.83329 8.33333L9.99996 12.5L14.1666 8.33333" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></button><div class="grid transition-all duration-300 w-full min-w-0 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden min-w-0 w-full"><p class="font-roboto text-xs md:text-base text-text-secondary leading-relaxed break-words [overflow-wrap:anywhere] [word-break:break-word] whitespace-pre-line">Shreeji Skyrise is developed by Shreeji Construction, a reputed real estate developer in